    "turn_text": "Well, something else that you've talked a little bit about on Twitter is this new study that estimates that the tax increases in President Biden's infrastructure proposal will cost about 1 million jobs. Can you talk a little bit about what's going on here and just that potential number, that cost of 1 million jobs?",
